// ChartKitchen in Superset (BI-Robotics #57, route C): a chart type `bir_chartkitchen`, loaded by Superset's dynamic
// plugins (feature flag DYNAMIC_PLUGINS, scripts/superset/SERVER_CHANGE.md). Superset import()s the bundle as an ES
